Apply this domain algorithm to prepared evidence: Construct staged migration plans with prerequisites, owners, compatibility shims where approved, and rollback conditions. Group consumers by meaningful risk and avoid advancing a wave before its required operational readiness evidence exists.
For each field, return a value only when supported, source IDs, authority, one rejected alternative, and status established, disputed, unknown, or inapplicable. Preserve contrary evidence and distinguish observation from inference.
